@ui @compare
Feature: Perfume comparison

    @smoke
    Scenario: As a user, I should see two perfumes and their comparison metrics, when I navigate to a comparison URL with two perfume items

    Scenario: As a user, I should see the selected perfume added and the items URL parameter updated, when I select a perfume from comparison search suggestions

    Scenario: As a user, I should see the selected perfume removed while the other perfume remains, when I click a comparison remove button

    Scenario: As a user, I should see the AI scent profile and performance analysis with a loading state, when I open a comparison containing two perfumes

    Scenario: As a logged in user, I should see my comparison comment in the comment list, when I submit İkisi de kış için uygun

    Scenario: As a user, I should see a perfume image in a closable lightbox, when I click an image in the comparison table

    Scenario: As a user, I should still see only four perfumes, when I try to add a fifth perfume to the comparison

    Scenario: As a user, I should see the comparison table scroll horizontally within its container without page overflow, when I open it at 375 pixels
